    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Felt warm last night; no rigors</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Blocked and runny nose, facial pressure, scratchy throat; no tooth or ear pain</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Slight dry cough; no wheeze or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new headache pattern, stiff neck, weakness or confusion; one ordinary migraine attack two days ago</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

